# Advanced photo merge.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = Méngale perspektif bi (ak wëréelu)
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama bu mel ni silindar
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Dindi nataal yu des ci mbir yiy dox (foto bu njëkk bi mooy dëggalukaay)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Guddaayu focal (px) / yaatuwaayu nataal bi (px)
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Li focus bi génne day jëfandikoo maske couche yu ñu mëna soppi. Tànnal maske ci Couche yi te rëdd ci kawam ngir jubanti.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = Gisuñu méngale bu wóor. Jëfandikool foto yu am ay benn-benn yu leer, yu bokk barab bu yaatu te seen perspektif wuutewul lool.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Nataal yu cosaan yi walla ayaru boole bi baaxul.
